# Deterministic line endings across Windows and Linux.
#
# The suite is authored on Windows and will later run on Linux runners. Anything
# byte-compared, hashed, or diffed must not differ by line ending alone — a test
# that fails only because of CRLF is indistinguishable from a real failure, and
# chasing one is exactly the wasted afternoon the anti-flake rule exists to prevent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
